---
// Download section - release links and source code
---

<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
  <div class="reveal panel-gradient-strong rounded-3xl border border-border p-10 text-center" data-reveal="left">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-4" data-i18n="download.title">
      Deploy the Vault
    </h2>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-8" data-i18n="download.description">
      Sanctum lives on your machine. Download the desktop app or audit the source on GitHub.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/yfloress/Sanctum/releases"
        class="btn-gradient shadow-glow rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:brightness-110 hover:shadow-xl active:scale-[0.98]"
        data-i18n="download.primary"
      >Desktop Releases</a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/yfloress/Sanctum"
        class="btn-surface rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:brightness-110 hover:shadow-lg active:scale-[0.98]"
        data-i18n="download.secondary"
      >View Source</a>
    </div>
    <dl class="grid gap-3 text-left sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-4">
        <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground" data-i18n="download.platforms.desktop.title">
          Desktop
        </dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-i18n="download.platforms.desktop.status">
          Linux, Windows and macOS. Where development happens today.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-4">
        <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground" data-i18n="download.platforms.android.title">
          Android
        </dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-i18n="download.platforms.android.status">
          Port in progress. No build to install yet.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-4">
        <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground" data-i18n="download.platforms.server.title">
          Your own server
        </dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-i18n="download.platforms.server.status">
          Planned. One vault across your devices, including iOS through the browser.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</div>
